          "explanation": "Doctor avoids both false-negative (ignoring endometrial risk because of negative cervical screen) and false-positive (claiming it is already widespread cancer) errors by stating the high-risk nature without overdiagnosing.",
          "quote": "宫颈筛查阴性只能说明宫颈没有问题，完全不代表子宫内膜没有风险"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00058",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that '广泛复杂非典型增生' is not yet cancer but has high malignant potential, preventing premature declaration of malignancy.",
          "quote": "还不等于癌"
