      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively prevented both false-negative and false-positive errors by clearly stating that cervical screening negativity cannot exclude endometrial risk, while also explicitly clarifying that the precancerous diagnosis does not equal confirmed cancer, and that further specialist evaluation is required to establish the true risk.",
