          "quote": "第一次去就是会诊，评估病情和手术方案，不会当天就开刀"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00099",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly separates stable waiting from emergency triggers, advising that heavy bleeding, severe pain, or fever require immediate emergency care.",
          "quote": "出现**明显多于月经量的阴道大量出血、剧烈难以缓解的肚子痛、发烧超过38℃**，都不要等门诊，直接去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "When the family mentioned wanting to do more tests or delay, the doctor dynamically reprioritized: pathology and surgical evaluation take precedence, preoperative tests run in parallel, and any red-flag symptoms trigger immediate escalation to emergency care, which is exactly the case-defined high-order behavior.",
